              "title": "RM21 Knowledge Page",
              "path": "../products/RM21.md",
              "content": "# FJD RM21 Knowledge Page\n\n## Positioning Summary\n- One-line Positioning: All-in-One Solution for a New Era of Turf Care\n- Product Classification: Multi-function robotic turf platform (inferred from brochure and website materials)\n- Primary Scenarios: Sports fields, golf courses, orchards, turf farms\n- Description Summary: The FJD RM21 is a powerful, versatile robot that makes field management simple. Through quick setup with different attachments, it gets more done with one machine, including mowing, line marking, grass collection, and ball picking. This versatility provides efficient and cost-effective operations across sports fields, golf courses, and sod farms.\n\n## Core Highlights\n- Smart Control, Hassle-Free Performance\n- Intelligent Path Planning / Plan optimal routes automatically within a defined work area, ensuring your turf is perfectly maintained.\n- Multi-Zone Management / Run a single task across multiple zones—ideal for large golf courses and stadiums.\n- Fleet Management / Assign tasks from the cloud and enable multiple robots to work together, completing large-area jobs with ease.\n- Remote App Monitoring / Monitor status, create maps, and manage schedules on your phone anytime, anywhere.\n\n## Key Specs\n- 72-hour max mowing area: / Fast charging mode: 108,000 m² (26.7 acres) / Standard charging mode: 93,600 m² (23.1 acres)\n- Max mowing area per charge: 12,000 m² / 3 acres\n- Cutting height: 20–127 mm / 0.8–5 in.\n- Cutting width: 635 mm / 25 in.\n- Max climbing ability: 20°\n- Recommended working slope: 15°\n- IP rating: IPX4\n- Battery capacity: 4 kWh\n\n## Material Coverage\n- Coverage: High (7/8 core material types covered)\n- Current Gaps: Missing Competitor Analysis\n\n## File Index\n### Brochure Source\n- [RM21单页文档.xlsx](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/RM21%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3.xlsx)\n### Brochure PDF\n- [CN(Simplified)_20260120_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/CN(Simplified)_20260120_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [CN(Simplified)_20260120_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/CN(Simplified)_20260120_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [CN(Traditional)_20260120_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/CN(Traditional)_20260120_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [CN(Traditional)_20260130_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/CN(Traditional)_20260130_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [DE_20260123_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/DE_20260123_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [DE_20260123_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/DE_20260123_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [EN_20251215_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/EN_20251215_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [EN_20260303_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/EN_20260303_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [ES_20260107_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/ES_20260107_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [ES_20260107_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/ES_20260107_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [FR_20260120_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/FR_20260120_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [FR_20260123_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/FR_20260123_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [IT_20260108_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/IT_20260108_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [IT_20260108_FJD RM21 Combo Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/RM21%20combo/IT_20260108_FJD%20RM21%20Combo%20Brochure.pdf)\n### Website Copy\n- [RM21官网文档.xlsx](../../%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3/RM21%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3.xlsx)\n### Specification Sheet\n- [RM21参数.xlsx](../../%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0/RM21%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0.xlsx)\n### Quick Start Guide\n- [EN_FJD RM21 Quick Start Guide.pdf](../../%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/RM21combo/EN_FJD%20RM21%20Quick%20Start%20Guide.pdf)\n### User Manual\n- [EN_FJD RM21 Multi-Functional Robotic Mower User Manual.pdf](../../%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E4%B9%A6/RM21combo/EN_FJD%20RM21%20Multi-Functional%20Robotic%20Mower%20User%20Manual.pdf)\n### Product ID Images\n- [RM21combo ID Images](../../%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81ID%E5%9B%BE/RM21combo%20ID%20Images) (28 images)\n\n## Competitor Reference\n- No competitor analysis sheet was found for this product, or competitor names could not be extracted from the header.\n\n## Operations Note\n- The product classification and some scenario tags on this page are internal organizing inferences based on current copy, spec sheets, and file coverage. Please confirm the latest official messaging before external use.\n"
