              "title": "Titan Knowledge Page",
              "path": "../products/Titan.md",
              "content": "# FJD Titan Knowledge Page\n\n## Positioning Summary\n- One-line Positioning: Elite 2-in-1 Turf Care. Without the Elite Price.\n- Product Classification: Flagship large-area mowing and line-marking platform (inferred from brochure and website materials)\n- Primary Scenarios: Golf courses, sports fields, public green spaces\n- Description Summary: Powered by a three-layer guidance system and smart fleet management, the FJD Titan delivers elite mowing performance for world-class golf courses and sports fields. It serves as a 2-in-1 solution equipped with a line-marking kit to ensure exceptional marking precision.\n\n## Core Highlights\n- Adjustable Cut Height / Adjust cutting height from 10–100 mm in-app to match turf type and season.\n- Wide-Cut Productivity / 730mm cutting width delivers high daily output—up to 36,000 m² (9 acres) per day.\n- 3-Layer Guidance System / Dual-antenna RTK GNSS, LiDAR, and Vision work together for stable positioning and obstacle avoidance.\n- One Scan, Endless Reusability / Map in minutes with the FJD Trion P2 LiDAR Scanner—no manual driving required. Create a digital asset shared across your entire fleet.\n- Multi-Field Management / Automated multi-field mowing with seamless transition between task areas.\n\n## Key Specs\n- Max mowing area* / 72 h Maximum coverage 108,000  m² (26.7 acres) / 24 h Maximum coverage 36,000  m² (9 acres)\n- Max mowing area per charge / 18,000  m² (4.5 acres)\n- Cutting height: / 10–100 mm / 0.4-4 in.\n- Cutting width: / 730 mm (260 mm each) / 28.7 in. (10.2 in. each)\n- Max climbing ability / 25° / 46%\n- Boundary type: / Virtual wire\n- Connectivity: / 4G, Wireless Connectivity\n- IP rating: / IP64\n\n## Material Coverage\n- Coverage: High (7/8 core material types covered)\n- Current Gaps: Missing Competitor Analysis\n\n## File Index\n### Brochure Source\n- [Titan单页文档.xlsx](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/Titan/Titan%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3.xlsx)\n### Brochure PDF\n- [EN_20260227_FJD Titan Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/Titan/EN_20260227_FJD%20Titan%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [EN_20260304_FJD Titan Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/Titan/EN_20260304_FJD%20Titan%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n### Website Copy\n- [Titan官网文档.xlsx](../../%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3/Titan%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3.xlsx)\n### Specification Sheet\n- [Titan参数.xlsx](../../%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0/Titan%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0.xlsx)\n### Quick Start Guide\n- [EN_Titan_Quick Start Guide.pdf](../../%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/Titan/EN_Titan_Quick%20Start%20Guide.pdf)\n### User Manual\n- [EN_Titan Robotic Mower_ User Manual.pdf](../../%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E4%B9%A6/Titan/EN_Titan%20Robotic%20Mower_%20User%20Manual.pdf)\n### Product ID Images\n- [Titan ID Images](../../%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81ID%E5%9B%BE/Titan%20ID%20Images) (39 images)\n\n## Competitor Reference\n- No competitor analysis sheet was found for this product, or competitor names could not be extracted from the header.\n\n## Operations Note\n- The product classification and some scenario tags on this page are internal organizing inferences based on current copy, spec sheets, and file coverage. Please confirm the latest official messaging before external use.\n"
