              "title": "FR4000 Knowledge Page",
              "path": "../products/FR4000.md",
              "content": "# FJD FR4000 Knowledge Page\n\n## Positioning Summary\n- One-line Positioning: Not extracted\n- Product Classification: Large-property residential / light commercial robotic mower (inferred from specs and material coverage)\n- Primary Scenarios: Large private lawns, light commercial landscaping\n- Description Summary: English description not extracted from current source files.\n\n## Core Highlights\n- No sufficient highlights were extracted from structured source files.\n\n## Key Specs\n- Recommended mowing area: 4000 m² (1 acre)*\n- Cutting height: / 20–60 mm / 0.8–2.4 in. / 10–50 mm / 0.4–2.0 in.*\n- Cutting width: 260 mm / 10.2 in.\n- Max climbing ability: 33° (65%)\n- Suggested mowing slope: 25° (47%)\n- Boundary type: Virtual wire\n- Connectivity: 4G, Wireless Connectivity\n- IP rating: / Mower: IPX5 / Charging station: IP65\n\n## Material Coverage\n- Coverage: Medium-High (6/8 core material types covered)\n- Current Gaps: Missing Brochure Source; Missing Website Copy\n\n## File Index\n### Brochure PDF\n- [CN(Simplified)_20251101_FJD FR4000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/CN(Simplified)_20251101_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [CN(Traditional)_20251103_FJD FR4000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/CN(Traditional)_20251103_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [DE_20251101_FJD FR4000 Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/DE_20251101_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [DE_20251101_FJD FR4000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/DE_20251101_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [EN_20251118_FJD FR4000 Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/EN_20251118_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [EN_20251121_FJD FR4000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/EN_20251121_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [ES_20260106_FJD FR4000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/ES_20260106_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [FR_20251107_FJD FR4000 Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/FR_20251107_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [FR_20251107_FJD FR4000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/FR_20251107_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [IT_20260108_FJD FR4000 Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/IT_20260108_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [IT_20260108_FJD FR4000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/IT_20260108_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [JP_20251101_FJD FR4000 Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/JP_20251101_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [JP_20251101_FJD FR4000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FR4000/JP_20251101_FJD%20FR4000%20Brochure.pdf)\n### Specification Sheet\n- [FR4000参数.xlsx](../../%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0/FR4000%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0.xlsx)\n### Quick Start Guide\n- [EN_FR4000_Quick Start Guide.pdf](../../%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/FR4000/EN_FR4000_Quick%20Start%20Guide.pdf)\n### User Manual\n- [EN_FR4000 Robotic Mower User Manual.pdf](../../%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E4%B9%A6/FR4000/EN_FR4000%20Robotic%20Mower%20User%20Manual.pdf)\n### Competitor Analysis\n- [FR4000竞品分析.xlsx](../../%E7%AB%9E%E5%93%81%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/FR4000%E7%AB%9E%E5%93%81%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.xlsx)\n### Product ID Images\n- [FR4000 ID Images](../../%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81ID%E5%9B%BE/FR4000%20ID%20Images) (7 images)\n\n## Competitor Reference\n- Husqvarna 550 EPOS\n- Mammotion Luba2 AWD 5000X\n- Kress 174E\n- Segway Navimow X350\n\n## Operations Note\n- The product classification and some scenario tags on this page are internal organizing inferences based on current copy, spec sheets, and file coverage. Please confirm the latest official messaging before external use.\n"
