              "title": "FV2000 Knowledge Page",
              "path": "../products/FV2000.md",
              "content": "# FJD FV2000 Knowledge Page\n\n## Positioning Summary\n- One-line Positioning: Not extracted\n- Product Classification: Residential robotic mower (inferred from brochure copy)\n- Primary Scenarios: Home gardens\n- Description Summary: Redefine lawn care at home with the FJD FV2000 robotic mower. Powered by advanced RTK and vision technology, it delivers precise mowing without perimeter wiring. With a recommended mowing area of 2,000 m², the FV2000 keeps your garden perfectly maintained, giving your family more time to relax, play, and enjoy your outdoor life together.\n\n## Core Highlights\n- PRECISE MOWING, PERFECT LAWNS.\n- Recommended Mowing Area 2,000㎡ (0.5 acre)\n- Max Slope up to 33° (65%)\n- EASY START, STEADY PERFORMANCE\n- Ready to Go in 10 Minutes / Skip the wires and complex setup. Just place the charging station, open the FJD Landscaping® App, and the FV2000 can be set into motion in minutes.\n\n## Key Specs\n- Recommended mowing area: 2000 m² (0.5 acres)*\n- The maximum mowing size is about 2,000m² (0.5 acres) per day. This depends on various factors, such as the area layout, grass conditions, terrain, weather, battery health, and other working conditions.\n- Cutting height: 20–60 mm / 0.8–2.4 in.\n- Cutting width: 260 mm / 10.2 in.\n- Max climbing ability: 33° (65%)\n- Suggested mowing slope: 25° (47%)\n- Boundary type: Virtual wire\n- Connectivity: 4G, Wireless Connectivity\n\n## Material Coverage\n- Coverage: High (7/8 core material types covered)\n- Current Gaps: Missing Website Copy\n\n## File Index\n### Brochure Source\n- [FV2000单页文档.xlsx](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FV2000/FV2000%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3.xlsx)\n### Brochure PDF\n- [EN_20251118_FJD FV2000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FV2000/EN_20251118_FJD%20FV2000%20Brochure.pdf)\n- [EN_20251120_FJD FV2000 Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FV2000/EN_20251120_FJD%20FV2000%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [IT_20260108_FJD FV2000 Brochure(for print).pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FV2000/IT_20260108_FJD%20FV2000%20Brochure(for%20print).pdf)\n- [IT_20260108_FJD FV2000 Brochure.pdf](../../%E5%8D%95%E9%A1%B5/FV2000/IT_20260108_FJD%20FV2000%20Brochure.pdf)\n### Specification Sheet\n- [FV2000参数.xlsx](../../%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0/FV2000%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0.xlsx)\n### Quick Start Guide\n- [EN_FV2000_Quick Start Guide.pdf](../../%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/FV2000/EN_FV2000_Quick%20Start%20Guide.pdf)\n### User Manual\n- [EN_FV2000 Robotic Mower User Manual.pdf](../../%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%E4%B9%A6/FV2000/EN_FV2000%20Robotic%20Mower%20User%20Manual.pdf)\n### Competitor Analysis\n- [FV2000竞品分析.xlsx](../../%E7%AB%9E%E5%93%81%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/FV2000%E7%AB%9E%E5%93%81%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.xlsx)\n### Product ID Images\n- [FV2000 ID Images](../../%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81ID%E5%9B%BE/FV2000%20ID%20Images) (12 images)\n\n## Competitor Reference\n- Mammotion LUBA mini AWD 1500\n- Segway Navimow H1500-VF\n- SUNSEEKER X7\n- Dreame A1\n\n## Operations Note\n- The product classification and some scenario tags on this page are internal organizing inferences based on current copy, spec sheets, and file coverage. Please confirm the latest official messaging before external use.\n"
